    "detailed_description": "Hypogean is a relaxed digging simulation which takes place in a neon, sci-fi underground city named Hypogea. The player is hired as the newest miner of Hypogea, an expert in wielding the so called \u201cdrilling machine.\u201d <br><br>Your goal is to mine ores, return them to the city, turn them in for cash, upgrade your drilling machine, and then repeat. Plain and simple. Hypogea corporation offers a wide variety of upgrades to your machinery, so that your mining endeavors become much more enjoyable, efficient, and interesting.<br><br>Explore different underground biomes, hypogean biotopes. <br>Find hidden and forgotten Driller Parts that previous miners left behind.<br>Unearth ancient valuables covered under tons of dirt and rock.<br><br>Key Features Of The Game:<br>- Explore a variety of cave biomes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094150/extras/1d968ed5697cb3ba280e40c8a676041e.avif?t=1697204389\" /></div><br><br>- Discover and excavate different kind of ores.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094150/extras/9c0aeab04e657639f865f0893a931c0e.avif?t=1697204389\" /></div><br><br>- Combine ores to create different kind of alloys and metals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094150/extras/7495388a65c3da65e641ddf8d1980420.avif?t=1697204389\" /></div><br><br>- Sell your findings for money to upgrade your driller.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094150/extras/6ae4b4f5d11bcd2c600d91b5120121ab.avif?t=1697204389\" /></div><br><br>- Customize your driller to your liking with cosmetics you find in the caves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094150/extras/200f17ae691d99ab3cd8d12b99ff75ba.avif?t=1697204389\" /></div>",
